  ["1z"] = "[LT] You are probably talking about the {FEMOR hills}.",
  ["20"] = "[LT] Ah yes. Well, the magic that led us here seems to be most potent at a certain time, close before sunrise. \\z\n\t\t\tPerhaps like a giant pulse, or beacon. Maybe the gods set it here, or a mad sorcerer, \\z\n\t\t\twe don't know for sure yet... The portal deep down in the caves, resonating with magical energy where you came \\z\n\t\t\tthrough, can maybe bring something else into this world as well. \\z\n\t\t\tSo it must be carefully guarded while we investigate the island for more clues... \\z\n\t\t\tThere are some very interesting archeological findings here on the island throughout. \\z\n\t\t\tSeems the island has drawn some cults here, but why they are gone now, no one knows.",
  ["21"] = "[LT] It seems that throughout its history, this island was inhabited by very different species. \\z\n\t\t\tI like to study their remains.",
  ["22"] = "[LT] Yeah. Long time I haven't been to that place. How's old Vascalir? Still hanging around in the academy? \\z\n\t\t\tAnd Kraknaknork? Hah, I remember our brawl after that last card game. Fun times.",
  ["23"] = "[LT] What about him? Is he in one of his dark moods again? That's his normal mood, I mean. \\z\n\t\t\tJust buy your armor, weaponry and ammunition there and don't worry.",
  ["24"] = "[LT] Hmmm. Interesting. If only someone could help investigate this.",
  ["25"] = "[LT] Tired of the academy, maybe, but not of teaching. If you need druid or sorcerer spells, go to him.",
  ["26"] = "[LT] Ah, good old Hamish. A real wizard with potions. \\z\n\t\t\tWill supply you with very useful magic equipment for hunting.",
  ["27"] = "[LT] Exactly. Has a nice ring to it.",
  ["28"] = "[LT] She's a good listener if you should still hesitate as to the choice of your definite vocation.",
  ["29"] = "[LT] Well, for him it's always been just a question of ''Your gold or your life'' - gold it is nowadays. \\z\n\t\t\tYou can stash your loose change at ol' Abram, but make sure to withdraw it once you leave Dawnport!",
  ["2A"] = "[LT] ... ...",
  ["2B"] = "[LT] Hmm. ...",
  ["2C"] = "[LT] Finally, reinforcements - oh but no, you came through the crystal portal, like the others! I am ser Menesto, I guard the portal. That beast caught me by surprise, I lost my dagger and had to retreat. ...",
  ["2D"] = "[LT] ... ...",
  ["2E"] = "[LT] Hmm. ...",
  ["2F"] = "[LT] You look hungry, you should eat regularly to reagain your strength! See what you can find while hunting. Or buy food in a city shop. Here, have some of my rations, I'll take my dagger. Tell me when you're {ready}.",
  ["2G"] = "[LT] I'll stay here till reinforcements come. Go up the ladder to reach the surface. You'll need a rope for the ropestot that comes after the ladder - here, take my spare equipment. ...",
  ["2H"] = "[LT] And remember: Tibia is a world with many dangers and mysteries, so be careful! Farewell, friend.",
  ["2I"] = "[LT] It's my duty to protect the city.",
  ["2J"] = "[LT] What a fascinating idea!",
  ["2K"] = "[LT] The Horn of Plenty is always open for tired adventurers.",
  ["2L"] = "[LT] I can offer you beer, wine, lemonade and water. If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["2M"] = "[LT] Are you looking for food? I have bread, cheese, ham, and meat. If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["2N"] = "[LT] The Horn of Plenty is always open for tired adventurers.",
  ["2O"] = "[LT] I can offer you lemonade, camel milk, and water. If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["2P"] = "[LT] Are you looking for food? I have bread, cheese, ham, and meat. If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["2Q"] = "[LT] The menu of the day sounds delicious!",
  ["2R"] = "[LT] The last visit to the theatre was quite rewarding.",
  ["2S"] = "[LT] Such a beautiful and wealthy city - with so many opportunities ...",
  ["2T"] = "[LT] Come in, young mages! Purchase the latest in runes and wands!",
  ["2U"] = "[LT] Perhaps I need to bake them hotter? Or was it longer?",
  ["2V"] = "[LT] Offering all sorts of magic equipment!",
