  ["2f"] = "[LT] <grumble> Maybe I should rearrange some warm currents to get rid of this horrible fog.",
  ["2g"] = "[LT] All these treasures I cannot reach... what a pity.",
  ["2h"] = "[LT] One of our ...less fortunate members lost an ancient amulet somewhere on the island, \\z\n\t\t\t\t\talong with his life. If you could retrieve the amulet at least, there's a little reward. \\z\n\t\t\t\t\tWould you go on that errand?",
  ["2i"] = "[LT] Look for a bush with yellow glowing flower buds. It grows only on a special, \\z\n\t\t\t\t\t\tlight grey-brown sand, and is usually surrounded by fireflies. \\z\n\t\t\t\t\t\tUse the herb to pluck off the fresh flower buds, and return to me.",
  ["2j"] = "[LT] One of our ...less fortunate members lost an ancient amulet somewhere on the island, along with his life. If you could retrieve the amulet at least, there's a little reward. Would you go on that errand?",
  ["2k"] = "[LT] I will reward you if you kill 20 minotaur bruisers. Would you do that?",
  ["2l"] = "[LT] Ah, you found the amulet! Ah. Really? Poor Dormovo. Always a bit hasty. Forgot his rope, or food, or potions - it was to be expected he would meet an early end. Oh, well. ...",
  ["2m"] = "[LT] Splendid. Those Dawnfire buds are just the thing against nasty troll bites, you know? But they're quite rare.",
  ["2n"] = "[LT] Look for a bush with yellow glowing flower buds. It grows only on a special, light grey-brown sand, and is usually surrounded by fireflies. Use the herb to pluck off the fresh flower buds, and return to me.",
  ["2o"] = "[LT] Mountain trolls are worse than magpies, stealing everything that's not nailed down. Lately, they have raided our ship and made off with most of the Captain's rum stock!",
  ["2p"] = "[LT] I will reward you if you kill 20 mountain trolls. Would you do that?",
  ["2q"] = "[LT] Footmen of the muglex clan are worse than magpies, stealing everything that's not nailed down. Lately, they have raided our ship and made off with most of the Captain's rum stock!",
  ["2r"] = "[LT] I will reward you if you kill 20 muglex clan footmen. Would you do that?",
  ["2s"] = "[LT] Minotaur bruisers are worse than magpies, stealing everything that's not nailed down. Lately, they have raided our ship and made off with most of the Captain's rum stock!",
  ["2t"] = "[LT] I have a quest that needs doing. Interested?",
  ["2u"] = "[LT] Hm. Well, you look like you want to take a look at the unknown yourself. \\z\n\t\t\tI might have a job for you. Choose what you would like to do - {fetch} some things, or {kill} some monsters.",
  ["2v"] = "[LT] There's three things that need to be found. You can look for an {amulet}, \\z\n\t\t\ta {log book} or pick some rare {herbs}. Take your pick.",
  ["2w"] = "[LT] Well, those monsters have grown very uppity lately. There's a choice of three - mountain {trolls}, \\z\n\t\t\tmuglex clan {goblins} or, if you are up to it or together with some friends, \\z\n\t\t\tthere's a need to weed out some risky {minotaur} bruisers. Choose your target.",
  ["2x"] = "[LT] Mr Morris will do.",
  ["2y"] = "[LT] There's always someone who needs to be at the front, to take the first step into the unknown. \\z\n\t\t\tMy whole life has been full of such steps.",
  ["2z"] = "[LT] Ah, that old story of how it was named? I spread it around. \\z\n\t\t\tCan't remember really what its origins are. Interesting archeological findings here, though.",
