  ["34"] = "[LT] You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't help you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["35"] = "[LT] I guess you couldn't convince Gamon to give you a stake, eh?",
  ["36"] = "[LT] Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["37"] = "[LT] There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["38"] = "[LT] I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["39"] = "[LT] I can sense that the druids north of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["3A"] = "[LT] Ran across Inigo a few times on some remote islands, years and years ago. \\z\n\t\t\tTalked him into coming along here, and he seems to enjoy helping newcomers find their way. \\z\n\t\t\tPassing his knowledge on to the next generation.",
  ["3B"] = "[LT] We found him here half-dead and fixed him up, now he fixes us dinner and roof beams. \\z\n\t\t\tDefinitely someone you should check out for food, a rope and a shovel.",
  ["3C"] = "[LT] Been together through many a desperate situation. A romantic underneath it all. \\z\n\t\t\tFound the time to specialise on spells for paladins and knights somewhere along the way.",
  ["3D"] = "[LT] Be careful that he doesn't bore you to death with accountants of, well, your bank account history.",
  ["3E"] = "[LT] Ah, the goblin who sneaks around here now and then? Lives in a cave to the west, somewhere.",
