  ["3K"] = "[LT] You're looking thoughtful. Maybe I can help you?",
  ["3L"] = "[LT] Hm. Well, you look like you want to take a look at the unknown yourself. \\z\n\t\t\tI might have a job for you. Choose what you would like to do - {fetch} some things, or {kill} some monsters.",
