  ["3j"] = "[LT] Passages to Senja, Folda and Vega.",
  ["3k"] = "[LT] Do you want a round-trip passage to ",
  ["3l"] = "[LT] Have a nice trip!",
  ["3m"] = "[LT] You shouldn't miss the experience.",
  ["3n"] = "[LT] Where do you want to go today? We serve the routes to {Folda}, {Senja} and {Vega} and back to Tibia.",
  ["3o"] = "[LT] We are ferrymen. We transport goods and passengers to the Ice Islands.",
  ["3p"] = "[LT] We are ferrymen. We transport goods and passengers to the Ice Islands.",
  ["3q"] = "[LT] Passages to Senja, Folda and Vega.",
  ["3r"] = "[LT] The lizards here are the chosen ones of their kind. We believe them to be the strongest warriors in these lands.So I lead my people here to learn their ways. We are mere assassins but they are using foreign techniques and seem to be far more efficient",
  ["3s"] = "[LT] We of the Grey Shadow clan are studying the ways of the Chosen. Our training is hard, encounters with the lizards often deadly. Every one of us fights on his own. Each one more deadly than the other. Under my lead we wil rise renewed, as the Shadow Nina.",
  ["3t"] = "[LT] I am Nina, leader of the Grey Shadow clan. Me and my followers, the Shadow Nina, are exploring the largely uncharted parts of the continent Zao.",
  ["3u"] = "[LT] Alright, I guess you need a stake first. Maybe Gamon can help you, the leg of a chair or something could just do. Try asking him for a stake, and if you have one, bring it back to me.",
  ["3v"] = "[LT] Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["3w"] = "[LT] Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["3x"] = "[LT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["3y"] = "[LT] No problem.",
  ["3z"] = "[LT] Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 gold?",
  ["40"] = "[LT] There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["41"] = "[LT] I can sense that the druids north of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["42"] = "[LT] I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["43"] = "[LT] Great drinks and snacks at fair prices!",
  ["44"] = "[LT] I've never been better! I love my new {job}!",
  ["45"] = "[LT] No sorry, I'm out of that business. Please ask {Obi} or {Lee'Delle} if you need a weapon.",
  ["46"] = "[LT] As an adventurer, you should always have at least a {backpack}, a {rope}, a {shovel}, a {weapon}, an {armor} and a {shield}.",
  ["47"] = "[LT] Ah, the monsters are far away. Let's party now!",
  ["48"] = "[LT] If you really want to talk about dungeons, visit Dallheim on the bridge near my bar.",
  ["49"] = "[LT] Ewww, I don't even want to think about the smell from the sewers right now!",
  ["4A"] = "[LT] I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["4B"] = "[LT] I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["4C"] = "[LT] I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["4D"] = "[LT] You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["4E"] = "[LT] The druids north of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["4F"] = "[LT] You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["4G"] = "[LT] Yes, I was informed what to do. Are you prepared to receive my line of the prayer?",
  ["4H"] = "[LT] The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["4I"] = "[LT] Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["4J"] = "[LT] So receive my prayer: 'Light shall be near - and darkness afar'. Now, bring your stake to Tibra in the Carlin church for the next line of the prayer. I will inform her what to do.",
  ["4K"] = "[LT] I will wait for you.",
  ["4L"] = "[LT] You should visit Tibra in the Carlin church now.",
  ["4M"] = "[LT] You already received my line of the prayer.",
  ["4N"] = "[LT] So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["4O"] = "[LT] Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["4P"] = "[LT] Welcome to the post office!",
  ["4Q"] = "[LT] If you need help with letters or parcels, just ask me. I can explain everything.",
  ["4R"] = "[LT] Hey, send a letter to your friend now and then. Keep in touch, you know.",
  ["4S"] = "[LT] I'm selling magic equipment. Come and have a look.",
  ["4T"] = "[LT] If you need runes, this is the market stall for you!",
  ["4U"] = "[LT] I am able to grant you the heart of the mountain's blessing. But I must ask of you to sacrifice |BLESSCOST| gold. Are you willing to part with that amount of wealth?",
  ["4V"] = "[LT] The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["4W"] = "[LT] Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["4X"] = "[LT] The druids north of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["4Y"] = "[LT] I know of a mysterious djinn, bound to an existence of slavery far to the north of Tiquanda's jungles. He is bound to tell you his secrets and offer you the 'blood of the mountain'. ...\\nI do not know where exactly but I guess you must first dig that one out to actually talk to him.",
  ["4Z"] = "[LT] I am one with nature, one with the ice and the cold. Names are of no worth out here. Out here, you face isolation and loneliness. Only your strength, willpower and {training} can keep you alive.",
  ["4a"] = "[LT] My life is one of hardship, hardship I chose freely. Endurance, strength and the power of the will are my only companions in this frigid wilderness. My strength comes from disciplined training and knowledge of the outdoors.",
  ["4b"] = "[LT] Receive the heart of the mountain then.",
  ["4c"] = "[LT] Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["4d"] = "[LT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["4e"] = "[LT] You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't help you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["4f"] = "[LT] Besides the {enhanced} blessing available from me, I know of one other, granted by a solitary {nomad} far west of Svargrond. There are also five different other blessings available, each in a sacred place. ...\\nThese blessings are: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}.",
  ["4g"] = "[LT] Well, as I am quite in a {fix} currently, my only hope to escape this situation may be to grant you {healing} or an {enhanced} blessing if you wish. You must desire SOMETHING, right? Sure you do.",
  ["4h"] = "[LT] You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["4i"] = "[LT] You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["4j"] = "[LT] Grrrrrrr.",
  ["4k"] = "[LT] <wiggles>",
  ["4l"] = "[LT] <sniff>",
  ["4m"] = "[LT] Woof! Woof!",
  ["4n"] = "[LT] Wooof!",
  ["4o"] = "[LT] Here in the whiteflower temple you may receive the blessing of spiritual shielding. But we must ask of you to sacrifice |BLESSCOST| gold. Are you still interested?",
  ["4p"] = "[LT] I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["4q"] = "[LT] I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["4r"] = "[LT] The druids north of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["4s"] = "[LT] You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["4t"] = "[LT] The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["4u"] = "[LT] Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["4v"] = "[LT] So receive the shielding of your spirit, pilgrim.",
  ["4w"] = "[LT] Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["4x"] = "[LT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["4y"] = "[LT] You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't help you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["4z"] = "[LT] Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["50"] = "[LT] Oh, Thais, I'll be back. One day, I'll be back.",
  ["51"] = "[LT] My good old cousin Sam. Oh, how I miss him.",
  ["52"] = "[LT] I think good practice is better than reading a boring book. Of course, you will need proper {equipment} to be able to get practice!",
  ["53"] = "[LT] Buy your weapons here!",
  ["54"] = "[LT]  told them to let me sell food, but no! Sorry, you have to ask {Willie} or {Billy} on the farms west of here.",
  ["55"] = "[LT] Good monsters to start with are rats. They live in the {sewers} under the village of {Rookgaard}.",
  ["56"] = "[LT] There are many sewer entrances throughout Rookgaard. One is right outside this shop and to the left. For more details about monsters and dungeons, best talk to one of the {guards}.",
  ["57"] = "[LT] The bridge guard {Dallheim} is north of here, just follow the street, you can't miss it.",
  ["58"] = "[LT] Sadly, not many merchants are as honest as I am.",
  ["59"] = "[LT] I wish I could help you with that, but no, I was told to stick to weapons. Go see {Lily}.",
  ["5A"] = "[LT] Oooh, I wouldn't dare gossiping about the king. He might have his spies here somewhere, you know.",
  ["5B"] = "[LT] This is the world we live in, oh-oh-oh, and these are the hands we're given, oh-oh... oh, I'm sorry, I got carried away!",
  ["5C"] = "[LT] As a premium adventurer you have many advantages, you should check them out!",
  ["5D"] = "[LT] I serve the best drinks in town! What's it gonna be, lemonade? Wine? Milk? Beer? Just ask me for a {trade}!",
  ["5E"] = "[LT] You know you want a party after all that tiring hunting!",
  ["5F"] = "[LT] The temple is a good place to visit if you're in urgent need for healing.",
  ["5G"] = "[LT] Well, the only help I could give you are some general {hints}. And a delicious {drink} along with it.",
  ["5H"] = "[LT] No sorry, I'm out of that business. Please ask {Al Dee} or {Lee'Delle} if you need equipment.",
  ["5I"] = "[LT] No sorry, I'm out of that business. Please ask {Dixi} or {Lee'Delle} if you need equipment.",
  ["5J"] = "[LT] Oh, would you like something to eat or drink? Ask me for a {trade} to see my offers!",
  ["5K"] = "[LT] <gets a dreamy look in her eyes>",
  ["5L"] = "[LT] Al Dee treats his customers friendly, but he's badmouthing them once he had a few beers.",
  ["5M"] = "[LT] I'm curious about her adventures. She really should come here more often!",
  ["5N"] = "[LT] He got lucky when Willie and him played a game of dice about who gets to farm on which side of the river. Ever since, Willie holds a grudge against him.",
  ["5O"] = "[LT] Hehe, that guy doesn't pretend to be anyone that he isn't. He is what he is - rude, but honest.",
  ["5P"] = "[LT] <sings> ... are a girl's best friieeend...",
  ["5Q"] = "[LT] Oh shush! It's kinda disgusting when he walks in here with animal blood on his hands!",
  ["5R"] = "[LT] What Seymour doesn't teach you is how much fun you can have here!",
  ["5S"] = "[LT] I invited her to my bar, but she refused. Oh well, it was worth a try!",
  ["5T"] = "[LT] I think that poor guy never gets a break from work. At least he never comes here.",
  ["5U"] = "[LT] That guy seriously needs some partying and a girlfriend.",
  ["5V"] = "[LT] The oracle is on the top floor of the academy. You should go there once you are level 8 to leave this island.",
  ["5W"] = "[LT] I think it's rather strange that he lives here with his granddaughter. No one's ever seen the parents of {Dixi}.",
  ["5X"] = "[LT] I hate that name, it sounds so boring. Almost like 'normal'. I think I should change my name to something more exciting. Like... Marylin! Oh, what a glamorous sound!",
  ["5Y"] = "[LT] She told me that she dreams of leaving this island to go on a big adventure.",
  ["5Z"] = "[LT] They tell me strange stories about him and some monsters in a hole. Weird!",
  ["5a"] = "[LT] Sing and dance at my bar! Yeah!",
  ["5b"] = "[LT] That girl thinks that she is soooo special and 'high society'. We used to be friends, but well, things change.",
  ["5c"] = "[LT] That's probably someone I'll never see in my bar.",
  ["5d"] = "[LT] <giggles> That monk with his holier-than-thou attitude hasn't anything against a good mug of wine now and then.",
  ["5e"] = "[LT] If you listen to him, you could get the impression my little bar is the devil himself. He says he has more work now keeping drunken adventurers in than monsters out of the city. Such an exaggeration!",
  ["5f"] = "[LT] Best place in town! Come to my bar!",
  ["5g"] = "[LT] Well, my name is {Norma}.",
  ["5h"] = "[LT] I used to be a merchant, but being a barkeeper is so much more fun. It's been my dream since I was a little girl.",
  ["5i"] = "[LT] It's about |TIME|. Time just flies, doesn't it?",
  ["5j"] = "[LT] To view the offers of a merchant, simply talk to him or her and ask for a {trade}. They will gladly show you their offers and also the things they buy from you.",
  ["5k"] = "[LT] Great drinks and snacks at fair prices!",
  ["5l"] = "[LT] You know you want a party after all that tiring hunting!",
  ["5m"] = "[LT] <sings> ... are a girl's best friieeend...",
  ["5n"] = "[LT] Sing and dance at my bar! Yeah!",
  ["5o"] = "[LT] Best place in town! Come to my bar!",
  ["5p"] = "[LT] Well, as you can see, I sell furniture. Ask me for a {trade} if you're interested to see my wares.",
  ["5q"] = "[LT] My name is Nydala. I run this store.",
  ["5r"] = "[LT] It is |TIME|. Do you need a clock for your house?",
  ["5s"] = "[LT] Only quality steel and wood used for my weapons!",
  ["5t"] = "[LT] It's about |TIME|. Yes, |TIME|. I'm so sorry, I have no watches for sale.",
  ["5u"] = "[LT] My name is Obi, just Obi, the honest merchant. If you like to {trade}, just ask.",
  ["5v"] = "[LT] I'm a merchant and the local {weapon} smith. If you like to see my quality wares or sell weapons to me, ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["5w"] = "[LT] As an adventurer you should always have at least a {backpack}, a {rope}, a {shovel}, a {weapon}, an {armor} and a {shield}.",
  ["5x"] = "[LT] If I were you, I'd invest my money in quality steel rather than putting it in a so-called safe bank account!",
  ["5y"] = "[LT] Well, the mainland also consists of several continents. You can go there once you are level 8 and have talked to the {oracle}.",
  ["5z"] = "[LT] Ah, Rookgaard. Home sweet home, that's what it became for me, but I will always miss {Thais} and {Sam}.",
  ["60"] = "[LT] I'm a pirate. Normally I'm sailing the seas, boarding other ships and gathering treasures. But at the moment my captain graciously assigned me to watch this {cursed} entrance.",
  ["61"] = "[LT] I'm One-Eyed Joe. From Josephina, got that? And I regard this eye patch as a personal feature of beauty!",
  ["62"] = "[LT] Good bye adventurer. It was nice to talk with you.",
  ["63"] = "[LT] Ah, the brave adventurer who sought to destroy the evil crystal down there. Have you been successful?",
  ["64"] = "[LT] Did you hear that, too?",
  ["65"] = "[LT] Did you hear that, too?",
  ["66"] = "[LT] Great, another supply ship is due. How is a dwarf supposed to work under these conditions?",
  ["67"] = "[LT] Ah, there's nothing like the sound of hammers in the morning.",
  ["68"] = "[LT] Then you should join the ranks of the paladins, noble hunters and rangers of the wild, who rely on the \\z\n\t\t\t\t\tswiftness of movement and ranged attacks. ...",
  ["69"] = "[LT] Paladins are jacks of all trades. They are tougher than the magically gifted and can carry more items \\z\n\t\t\t\t\tthan druids or sorcerers, but they can take not as much damage as a knight can. ...",
  ["6A"] = "[LT] There are many blueberry bushes in and around this village. Nature's for free.",
  ["6B"] = "[LT] I'm fine. It's a little hot near the crucible, but I enjoy the sound of forging {weapons}.",
  ["6C"] = "[LT] Just ask me for a {trade} to see which things I buy from you.",
  ["6D"] = "[LT] Oh, just upstairs. My granddaughter {Dixi} is in charge of selling armors and shields.",
  ["6E"] = "[LT] Selling and buying all sorts of weapons, come and have a look!",
  ["6F"] = "[LT] Yes, I'm selling weapons. Just ask me for a {trade} to see my offers and the things I buy from you.",
  ["6G"] = "[LT] Well, no gold, no deal. Earn gold by fighting {monsters} and picking up the things they carry. Sell it to {merchants} to make profit!",
  ["6H"] = "[LT] I wish I could help you with that, but no, I was told to stick to weapons. Go see {Al Dee} or {Lee'Delle}.",
  ["6I"] = "[LT] I sell {weapons} of all kinds. Just ask me for a {trade} if you like to see my offers.",
  ["6J"] = "[LT] I don't know how anyone could give up the flourishing business she led. She should have listened to me and find someone who continues that business for her.",
  ["6K"] = "[LT] I told him there was no danger, but he wouldn't listen to me, no one listens to me.",
  ["6L"] = "[LT] I suggested him opening a tourist guide company with me, Obi's and Santiago's, but he didn't approve. I really don't understand why.",
  ["6M"] = "[LT] An old woman shouldn't be treated like that, no way, that's bad.",
  ["6N"] = "[LT] Oh, this guy is so greedy, so greedy. Ripping off poor adventurers like you!",
  ["6O"] = "[LT] She is beautiful, very, very beautiful. I hope I can impress her somehow.",
  ["6P"] = "[LT] Give those monsters a good whipping with my weapons!",
  ["6Q"] = "[LT] He's just like his cousin {Willie}.",
  ["6R"] = "[LT] This guy doesn't understand that he should entrust me with the food business, too. He really should do. Then he had time for his farm.",
  ["6S"] = "[LT] He shouldn't heal people for free, no he shouldn't. That would be a great source of income for the village that could be invested in enhancing the smithy.",
  ["6T"] = "[LT] Oh, what an endearing little girl, and she's working so hard to help me, even without receiving payment. Such a sweet little girl!",
  ["6U"] = "[LT] I don't like him, actually I dislike him deeply. He is so greedy that he doesn't want to share his profit he gains from health potions.",
  ["6V"] = "[LT] She ruins the market with her offers! This is bad for us honest merchants, really bad.",
  ["6W"] = "[LT] I knew it! I knew she would try to get the monopoly on potions in this village! But no one has listened to me!",
  ["6X"] = "[LT] The oracle, ah, such a weird being! It will lead you off this island once you are level 8, yes it will, mark my words.",
  ["6Y"] = "[LT] I told everyone he will cause trouble. He talks people into giving him their money and putting it on the {bank}! They rather should leave it here with us honest merchants!",
  ["6Z"] = "[LT] He is the head of the local academy. I encouraged him to sponsor you, but no one listens to Obi, no one listens to me, as usual.",
  ["6a"] = "[LT] Well, how can I help you? Do you need some general {hints}? Or, if you're interested in a {trade}, just ask.",
  ["6b"] = "[LT] Well, he just buys what no one else wants. Stuff that's long dead. I can live with that, yes, I can live with that.",
  ["6c"] = "[LT] What a hero, what a hero.",
  ["6d"] = "[LT] What kind of information do you need? I could tell you about different topics such as {equipment}, {monsters} or {Rookgaard} in general.",
  ["6e"] = "[LT] {Al Dee} sells torches.",
  ["6f"] = "[LT] Be careful down there! Make sure you bought enough {torches} and a {rope} or you might get lost.",
  ["6g"] = "[LT] The king encouraged salesmen to travel here, but only I dared to take the risk, and a risk it was!",
  ["6h"] = "[LT] Only quality steel and wood used for my weapons!",
  ["6i"] = "[LT] Buy your weapons here!",
  ["6j"] = "[LT] Selling and buying all sorts of weapons, come and have a look!",
  ["6k"] = "[LT] Give those monsters a good whipping with my weapons!",
  ["6l"] = "[LT] Hm.",
  ["6m"] = "[LT] Yes. I listen, master.",
  ["6n"] = "[LT] I understand.",
  ["6o"] = "[LT] Not yet, my brothers. Wait.",
  ["6p"] = "[LT] Do you seek a passage to the ",
  ["6q"] = "[LT] Maybe another time.",
  ["6r"] = "[LT] I can bring you either to the east end of Port Hope or to the west end of the town, where would you like to go?",
  ["6s"] = "[LT] Typical. Easy come, easy go.",
  ["6t"] = "[LT] He will PAY for this... They will ALL pay!",
  ["6u"] = "[LT] <groan>",
  ["6v"] = "[LT] If I ever lay hands on him again...",
  ["6w"] = "[LT] Hmm. No, I don't think so. I still feel this strange prickling in my toes.",
  ["6x"] = "[LT] Too bad.",
  ["6y"] = "[LT] Protect your ears? Hmm ... Wasn't there some fabulous seafarer who used wax or something to plug his ears? There was a story about horrible bird-women or something ...? No, sounds like hogwash, doesn't it.",
  ["6z"] = "[LT] Great! Good luck and be careful down there!",
  ["70"] = "[LT] I can't imagine a better place to live.",
  ["71"] = "[LT] He used to visit me for a chat, but ever since that new tavern opened I haven't seen him much anymore.",
  ["72"] = "[LT] He sometimes delivers fruit and vegetables to this quarter.",
  ["73"] = "[LT] Though the city has seen better days, the quality of life is still much better than in most other cities.",
  ["74"] = "[LT] I can't imagine a better place to live",
  ["75"] = "[LT] Whatever that's supposed to mean.",
  ["76"] = "[LT] I don't have anything that I could give you as a reward. Guess you aren't so selfless after all, huh?",
  ["77"] = "[LT] They try to protect the city and do a decent job. Well - no, a poor job, I mean a poor job.",
  ["78"] = "[LT] You can bring me a mug of tea if you want to.",
  ["79"] = "[LT] Though the city has seen better days, the quality of life is still much better than in most other cities.",
  ["7A"] = "[LT] Paladins deal more damage than knights but less than druids or sorcerers, and have the longest range \\z\n\t\t\t\t\tin their distance attacks. ...",
  ["7B"] = "[LT] They can also use holy magic to slay the unholy and undead in particular. ...",
  ["7C"] = "[LT] Then you should choose the {vocation} of a knight and become a valiant fighter with sword and shield. ...",
  ["7D"] = "[LT] Then you should learn the ways of the druids, healers and powerful masters of natural magic. ...",
  ["7E"] = "[LT] Druids can heal their friends and allies, but they can also cast powerful ice and earth magic to kill their enemies. They can do a little energy, fire or death damage as well. ...",
  ["7F"] = "[LT] Druids cannot take much damage or carry many items, but they deal much more damage than paladins or knights. ...",
  ["7G"] = "[LT] So tell me: DO YOU WISH TO BECOME A SAGACIOUS DRUID? Answer with a proud {YES} if that is your choice!",
  ["7H"] = "[LT] Then you should become a sorcerer, a mighty wielder of deathly energies and arcane fire. ...",
  ["7I"] = "[LT] Sorcerers are powerful casters of magic. They use fire, energy and death magic to lay low their enemies. They can do a little ice or earth damage as well. ...",
  ["7J"] = "[LT] Sorcerers cannot take much damage or carry many items, but they deal much more damage than paladins or knights. ...",
  ["7K"] = "[LT] So tell me: DO YOU WISH TO BECOME A POWERFUL SORCERER? Answer with a proud {YES} if that is your choice!",
  ["7L"] = "[LT] SO BE IT. CAST OFF YOUR TRAINING GEAR AND RISE, NOBLE",
  ["7M"] = "[LT] ! ...",
  ["7N"] = "[LT] Knights are the toughest of all vocations. They can take more damage and carry more items than the other vocations, but they will deal less damage than paladins, druids or sorcerers. ...",
  ["7O"] = "[LT] Go through the second door from the right. Open the chest and take the equipment inside before you leave to the north. ...",
  ["7P"] = "[LT] Take the ship to reach the Mainland. Farewell, friend and good luck in all you undertake!",
  ["7Q"] = "[LT] As you wish. If you wish to learn something about the",
  ["7R"] = "[LT] vocation, tell me.",
  ["7S"] = "[LT] Knights can wield one- or two-handed swords, axes and clubs, and they can cast a few spells to draw a monster's attention to them. ...",
  ["7T"] = "[LT] So tell me: DO YOU WISH TO BECOME A VALIANT KNIGHT? Answer with a proud {YES} if that is your choice!",
  ["7U"] = "[LT] Then you should join the ranks of the paladins, noble hunters and rangers of the wild, who rely on the swiftness of movement and ranged attacks. ...",
  ["7V"] = "[LT] Paladins are jacks of all trades. They are tougher than the magically gifted and can carry more items than druids or sorcerers, but they can take not as much damage as a knight can. ...",
  ["7W"] = "[LT] Paladins deal more damage than knights but less than druids or sorcerers, and have the longest range in their distance attacks. ...",
  ["7X"] = "[LT] They can also use holy magic to slay the unholy and undead in particular. ...",
  ["7Y"] = "[LT] DO YOU WISH TO BECOME A DARING PALADIN? Answer with a proud {YES} if that is your choice!",
  ["7Z"] = "[LT] You can't take it all with you - sell your Dawnport things before \\z\n\t\tyou receive the gear of your definite vocation!",
  ["7a"] = "[LT] I can {heal} you if you are hurt. I can also help you choose your {vocation}. ",
  ["7b"] = "[LT] Behind each of those doors, the equipment and skills of one vocation lies - \\z\n\t\tsorcerer, paladin, knight or druid. ...",
  ["7c"] = "[LT] He has seen much, and likes to help the younger ones. If you have questions about what to do, \\z\n\t\t\tor whom to ask for anything, go to Inigo.",
  ["7d"] = "[LT] Found a new way of living and took to it like a fish to water.",
  ["7e"] = "[LT] Ah. Some wounds never heal. <sighs> Shipwrecked in body and mind. Nowhere to go, so he doesn't leave.",
  ["7f"] = "[LT] He broods over problems he won't share. But maybe you can help him with a little quest or two.",
  ["7g"] = "[LT] He lives only for his experiments and potions",
  ["7h"] = "[LT] I have heard of it, yes.",
  ["7i"] = "[LT] Leave all Dawnport things behind you and choose your destiny!",
  ["7j"] = "[LT] Come to me if you need healing!",
  ["7k"] = "[LT] Choose your vocation and explore the mainland!",
  ["7l"] = "[LT] Talk to me to choose your definite vocation! Become a knight, paladin, druid or sorcerer!",
  ["7m"] = "[LT] World needs brave adventurers like you. Choose your vocation and sail to the mainland!",
  ["7n"] = "[LT] Poisoned? Bleeding? Wounded? I can help!",
  ["7o"] = "[LT] I am Oressa Fourwinds, the {healer}. ",
  ["7p"] = "[LT] If you are hurt my child, I will {heal} your wounds.",
  ["7q"] = "[LT] You can't take it all with you - sell your Dawnport things before \\z\n\t\tyou receive the gear of your definite vocation!",
  ["7r"] = "[LT] Leave all Dawnport things behind you and choose your destiny!",
  ["7s"] = "[LT] Come to me if you need healing!",
  ["7t"] = "[LT] Choose your vocation and explore the mainland!",
  ["7u"] = "[LT] Talk to me to choose your definite vocation! Become a knight, paladin, druid or sorcerer!",
  ["7v"] = "[LT] World needs brave adventurers like you. Choose your vocation and sail to the mainland!",
  ["7w"] = "[LT] Poisoned? Bleeding? Wounded? I can help!",
  ["7x"] = "[LT] In this category I have '{Bruise Bane}', '{Cure Bleeding}', '{Wound Cleansing}', '{Cure Poison}', '{Intense Wound Cleansing}', '{Recovery}' and '{Intense Recovery}'.",
  ["7y"] = "[LT] In this category I have '{Light}', '{Find Person}', '{Magic Rope}', '{Levitate}', '{Haste}', '{Charge}' and '{Great Light}'.",
  ["7z"] = "[LT] I can teach you {healing spells}, {attack spells} and {support spells}. What kind of spell do you wish to learn? You can also tell me for which level you would like to learn a spell, if you prefer that.",
  ["80"] = "[LT] Don't forget to deposit your money here in the Global Bank before you head out for adventure.",
  ["81"] = "[LT] Do you seek a passage to ",
  ["82"] = "[LT] Maybe later.",
  ["83"] = "[LT] I'm a fisherman and I take along people to Edron. You can also buy some fresh fish.",
  ["84"] = "[LT] I'm a fisherman and I take along people to Edron. You can also buy some fresh fish.",
  ["85"] = "[LT] My fish is of the finest quality you could find. Ask me for a trade to check for yourself.",
  ["86"] = "[LT] It's a lovely and peaceful isle. Did you already visit the nice sandy beach?",
  ["87"] = "[LT] My name is Pemaret, the fisherman.",
  ["88"] = "[LT] I am miss Penny, your secretary.",
  ["89"] = "[LT] Yep, Penny's my name. You seem to be as smart as you're talkative.",
  ["8A"] = "[LT] Hm, good question. Maybe old, wise man?",
  ["8B"] = "[LT] I'm used to being called old man. Simple as that.",
  ["8C"] = "[LT] I don't know what you're talking about.",
  ["8D"] = "[LT] Yes, it's a bit messy down there. Sorry.",
  ["8E"] = "[LT] Doesn't ring a bell.",
  ["8F"] = "[LT] He rarely comes here.",
  ["8G"] = "[LT] A man of the seas.",
  ["8H"] = "[LT] I think the gods are too busy to care about us mortals, hmm... that makes me feel godlike, too.",
  ["8I"] = "[LT] It is nearly tea time, so please hurry!",
  ["8J"] = "[LT] It's rumoured that Sam does not forge all weapons himself, but buys them from his cousin, who is married to a cyclops.",
  ["8K"] = "[LT]  If you want to see dungeons just don't pay your taxes.",
  ["8L"] = "[LT] It's beyond all doubt that certain sinister elements in our city have certain knowledge about this myth.",
  ["8M"] = "[LT] You are not the first one to ask about that. Am I the only one that preferes wine to such disgusting stuff?",
  ["8N"] = "[LT] What do you expect from ex-soldiers? He is nuts! Hacked on the head far too often.",
  ["8O"] = "[LT] Isn't he the artist formerly known as the prince?",
  ["8P"] = "[LT] I never found any rumour concerning him, isn't that odd?",
  ["8Q"] = "[LT] They say she killed over a dozen husbands already.",
  ["8R"] = "[LT] This man lives in the darkness like a rat and is also as handsome as one of them. He surely is up to no good and often consorts with sinister strangers.",
  ["8S"] = "[LT] I am honored to be the assistant of the great, the illustrious, the magnificent {Durin}!",
  ["8T"] = "[LT] Just last week a one eyed man, who had a room at Frodo's, met him in the middle of the night.",
  ["8U"] = "[LT] He sells his scrolls far too expensive.",
  ["8V"] = "[LT] I was told he lost a body part or two in duels... if you know what I mean.",
  ["8W"] = "[LT] He is rumoured to summon kinky demons to... well you know.",
  ["8X"] = "[LT] You know a rumour? TELL ME! TELL ME! TELL ME!",
  ["8Y"] = "[LT] Fascinating! Absolutely fascinating!",
  ["8Z"] = "[LT] I heard he was a ladies' man in younger days. In our days he is rumoured to wear women clothes now and then.",
  ["8a"] = "[LT] A simple shopkeeper with minor intelligence.",
  ["8b"] = "[LT] They say he isn't truly dead. He was... or is a necromant after all.",
  ["8c"] = "[LT]  Some say he is Ferumbras in disguise.",
  ["8d"] = "[LT] I am honored to be the assistant of the great, the illustrious, the magnificent {Durin}!",
  ["8e"] = "[LT] What a shame. He claimed to be the king of thiefs and was caught stealing some fruit.",
  ["8f"] = "[LT] Just between you and me, he can be quite a tyrant.",
  ["8g"] = "[LT] AHHHH!!! WHERE??? WHERE???",
  ["8h"] = "[LT] I have a job of great responsibility, mostly I keep annoying persons away from my boss.",
  ["8i"] = "[LT] You better don't ask, you wouldn't like the answer.",
  ["8j"] = "[LT] Ah, yes, yes, hail to King {Tibianus}! Long live the king and so on...",
  ["8k"] = "[LT] I overheard a conversation of officials, that magic will be forbidden soon.",
  ["8l"] = "[LT] My name is Oswald, but let's proceed, I am a very busy man.",
  ["8m"] = "[LT] Hey, I am not a shopkeeper, I am an important man!",
  ["8n"] = "[LT] I am the grand druid of Carlin. I am responsible for the guild, the fields, and our citizens' health.",
  ["8o"] = "[LT] Every druid is able to learn the numerous spells of our craft.",
  ["8p"] = "[LT] Sorry, I don't teach spells for your vocation.",
  ["8q"] = "[LT] I am Padreia, grand druid of our fine city.",
  ["8r"] = "[LT] Time is just a crystal pillar - the centre of creation and life.",
  ["8s"] = "[LT] We are druids, preservers of life. Our magic is about defence, healing, and nature.",
  ["8t"] = "[LT] Sorcerers are destructive. Their power lies in destruction and pain.",
  ["8u"] = "[LT] You mean that's a JAIL? They told me it's the finest hotel in town! THAT explains the lousy roomservice!",
  ["8v"] = "[LT] You mean that's a JAIL? They told me it's the finest hotel in town! THAT explains the lousy roomservice!",
  ["8w"] = "[LT] You mean that's a JAIL? They told me it's the finest hotel in town! THAT explains the lousy roomservice!",
  ["8x"] = "[LT] Every Adventurer has one. \\z\n\t\t\t\t\tThe big advantage is that you can access your money in every branch of the World Bank! ...",
  ["8y"] = "[LT] Every Adventurer has one. The big advantage is that you can access your money in every branch of the World Bank! ...",
  ["8z"] = "[LT] Would you like to know more about the {basic} functions of your bank account, the {advanced} functions, or are you already bored, perhaps?",
