  ["BYA"] = "[LT] In some way their tainted knowledge brought the unthinkable into a resemblance of existence. ...",
  ["BYB"] = "[LT] That is why we cant dabble too much in figuring this out and rather concentrate on our fight to severe its ties to our world.",
  ["BYC"] = "[LT] Lost. Hidden. The keys are shadow names. Find them, they will talk to me and reveal what is hidden. Will you go on that quest?",
  ["BYD"] = "[LT] Yes. Have you gone there and found what you sought?",
  ["BYE"] = "[LT] Tell me. Begin with the colour.",
  ["BYF"] = "[LT] Yes. The shadows say this is true. The beauty of House Dunesea, name it.",
  ["BYG"] = "[LT] The floating gardens. Too beautiful to lie asleep in the memory of men. Yes. The name that is no more in Darkstone?",
