  ["Ija"] = "[LT] Ah, the impetuosity of youth.",
  ["Ijb"] = "[LT] Good bye. You are welcome.",
  ["Ijc"] = "[LT] Ahoi, young man |PLAYERNAME| and welcome to the Nordic Tibia Ferries. If you need a {passage}, let me know.",
  ["Ijd"] = "[LT] Greetings, traveller |PLAYERNAME|. Is there anything I can {do for you}?",
  ["Ije"] = "[LT] Do you want to travel to Svargrond?",
  ["Ijf"] = "[LT] The giant glimmercap mushroom exists in caves and other preferably warm and humid places. Use an ordinary kitchen spoon on a mushroom to collectits spores. Do you have the glimmercap spores?",
  ["Ijg"] = "[LT] Here you are. A waterskin!",
  ["Ijh"] = "[LT] You don't have enough money.",
  ["Iji"] = "[LT] Thank you for this ingredient. Now bring me Geyser {Water} in a Waterskin.",
  ["Ijj"] = "[LT] Come back when you have the ingredient.",
  ["Ijk"] = "[LT] Thank you for this ingredient. Now bring me Fine {Sulphur}.",
  ["Ijl"] = "[LT] Come back when you have the ingredient.",
  ["Ijm"] = "[LT] Thank you for this ingredient. Now bring me the Frostbite {Herb}",
  ["Ijn"] = "[LT] Come back when you have the ingredient.",
  ["Ijo"] = "[LT] Thank you for this ingredient Now bring me Purple Kiss {Blossom}.",
  ["Ijp"] = "[LT] What for ingredient do you have?",
  ["Ijq"] = "[LT] Come back when you have the ingredient.",
  ["Ijr"] = "[LT] Thank you for this ingredient. Now bring me the {Hydra Tongue}",
  ["Ijs"] = "[LT] Come back when you have the ingredient.",
  ["Ijt"] = "[LT] Thank you for this ingredient. Now bring me {Spores} of a Giant Glimmercap Mushroom.",
  ["Iju"] = "[LT] Come back when you have the ingredient.",
  ["Ijv"] = "[LT] Thank you for this ingredient. Now you finish your {mission}",
  ["Ijw"] = "[LT] Come back when you have the ingredient.",
  ["Ijx"] = "[LT] Then come back when you have the ingredient.",
  ["Ijy"] = "[LT] I have now no mission for you.",
  ["Ijz"] = "[LT] Do you want to buy a waterskin for 25 gold?",
  ["Ik"] = "[LT] Thank you, I'm fine, the gods are with me.",
  ["Ik0"] = "[LT] They created Tibia and all life on it ... and unlife, too.",
  ["Ik1"] = "[LT] Beware the foul undead!",
  ["Ik2"] = "[LT] Beware the foul undead!",
  ["Ik3"] = "[LT] A weapon of myth and legend. It was lost in ancient times ... perhaps lost forever.",
  ["Ik4"] = "[LT] Yenny, known as the Gentle, was one of most powerfull magicwielders in ancient times and known throughout the world for her mercy and kindness.",
  ["Ik5"] = "[LT] I can offer you the holy tible for a small fee.",
  ["Ik6"] = "[LT] I can offer you the holy tible for a small fee.",
  ["Ik7"] = "[LT] I can offer you the holy tible for a small fee.",
  ["Ik8"] = "[LT] I can offer you the holy tible for a small fee.",
  ["Ik9"] = "[LT] Many perished in their battles against evil, some went mad, not able to stand their nightmares any longer. Others were seduced by the darkness.",
  ["IkA"] = "[LT] Remember: If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can heal you for free.",
  ["IkB"] = "[LT] It was a pleasure to help you, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["IkC"] = "[LT] Hello. How may I help you |PLAYERNAME|? Ask me for a {trade} if you want to buy something. I can also explain the {mail} system.",
  ["IkD"] = "[LT] See you my friend.",
  ["IkE"] = "[LT] You are....kind of tall! Hello.",
  ["IkF"] = "[LT] I don't see how you could help me. I'm in deep, deep trouble. I'm accused of having stolen a {ring} from Rerun, but I haven't.",
  ["IkG"] = "[LT] WHAT?! I can't believe it. You saved my life... well, at least one week of it 'cause that would have been the time I had to spend in jail. If you want to, you can pass the door now and take a look at the northern mines. Have fun!",
  ["IkH"] = "[LT] Maybe Grombur knows more than me. The thing is he won't talk to me, and he will surely not accuse his best friend as a liar. What a dilemma!",
  ["IkI"] = "[LT] He's a miner in the southern wing. Maybe he has lost the ring there... but even if I find the ring, no one will believe me. Someone should talk to Grombur. He's Rerun's best friend.",
  ["IkJ"] = "[LT] He's a good emperor but I doubt he is wise enough to see the truth behind that false accusation against me. If just someone would find out the truth about that whole mess.",
  ["IkK"] = "[LT] See you my friend.",
  ["IkL"] = "[LT] Keep a stiff upper lip!",
  ["IkM"] = "[LT] Ah, another diciple of the extreme... surviving the icy outdoors? Let me {help}! If you need some first aid out here, I can provide {healing} or grant you an {enhanced} blessing!",
  ["IkN"] = "[LT] Keep a stiff upper lip!",
  ["IkO"] = "[LT] Woof! <wiggle>",
  ["IkP"] = "[LT] <sniff> Woof! <sniff>",
  ["IkQ"] = "[LT] Woof! <wiggle>",
  ["IkR"] = "[LT] Hm? Oh! Oh, yes a... visitor! Intruder? Benefactor...? Wha- what are you? If you want to pass through this cave, I may have to disappoint you. Or maybe not. It... depends. So, just passing through?",
  ["IkS"] = "[LT] Well, bye then.",
  ["IkT"] = "[LT] Psst, not that {loud}.",
  ["IkU"] = "[LT] Welcome, pilgrim. How may I {help} you? Are you in need of {healing}?",
  ["IkV"] = "[LT] Come back soon!",
  ["IkW"] = "[LT] Welcome, welcome! Have a seat! If you like a drink or something to eat, just ask me for a {trade}!",
  ["IkX"] = "[LT] Hey, where are you going? We've just started!",
  ["IkY"] = "[LT] Welcome to Carlin Furniture Store, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["IkZ"] = "[LT] Farewell, I hope you were satisfied with our service.",
  ["Ika"] = "[LT] Hello, hello, |PLAYERNAME|! Please come in, look, and buy! If you like to see my offers, ask me for a {trade}!",
  ["Ikb"] = "[LT] Um yeah, good day.",
  ["Ikc"] = "[LT] A shadow preceded you. You wish?",
  ["Ikd"] = "[LT] You don't have it...",
  ["Ike"] = "[LT] Good Bye, |PLAYERNAME|",
  ["Ikf"] = "[LT] Welcome |PLAYERNAME|! Only rarely I can welcome {visitors} these days.",
  ["Ikg"] = "[LT] How do you know? Did you go into the infested area?",
  ["Ikh"] = "[LT] What a pity! Let me know when you managed to get in there. Maybe I can help you when we know what we are dealing with.",
  ["Iki"] = "[LT] No then.",
  ["Ikj"] = "[LT] Ah, the curse of the Plains of Havoc, the hidden beast, the unbeatable foe. I've been living here for years and I'm sure this is only a myth.",
  ["Ikk"] = "[LT] There are many tales about the fearsome Hugo. It's said it's an abnormality, accidentally created by Yenny the Gentle. It's half demon, half something else and people say it's still alive after all these years.",
  ["Ikl"] = "[LT] Yenny, known as the Gentle, was one of the most powerful wielders of magic in ancient times. She was known throughout the world for her mercy and kindness.",
  ["Ikm"] = "[LT] Would you like to buy a The Holy Tible for 1000 gold?",
  ["Ikn"] = "[LT] You need to complete the quest for the book first before you can buy The Holy Tible.",
  ["Iko"] = "[LT] Here is your The Holy Tible.",
  ["Ikp"] = "[LT] You do not have enough money.",
  ["Ikq"] = "[LT] You better don't return here until you've defeated the Demon Oak.",
  ["Ikr"] = "[LT] A demon oak?!? <mumbles some blessings> May the gods be on our side. You'll need a {hallowed axe} to harm that tree. Bring me a simple {axe} and I'll prepare it for you.",
  ["Iks"] = "[LT] I don't believe a word of it! How rude to lie to a monk!",
  ["Ikt"] = "[LT] Ahh, you've got an axe. Very good. I can make a hallowed axe out of it. It will cost you... er... a donation of 1,000 gold. Alright?",
  ["Iku"] = "[LT] You have to first talk about {demon oak} or the {mission} before we continue.",
  ["Ikv"] = "[LT] Let's see....<mumbles a prayer>....here we go. The blessing on this axe will be absorbed by all the demonic energy around here. I presume it will not last very long, so better hurry. Actually, I can refresh the blessing as often as you like.",
  ["Ikw"] = "[LT] There is no axe with you.",
  ["Ikx"] = "[LT] There is not enough of money with you.",
  ["Iky"] = "[LT] This ancient order was created by a circle of wise humans who were called 'The {Dreamers}'. The order became {extinct} a long time ago.",
  ["Ikz"] = "[LT] That's where we are. The world of Tibia.",
  ["Il"] = "[LT] Pheeew! That sounds disgusting! Are you a cook at Frodo's?",
  ["Il0"] = "[LT] Bye.",
  ["Il1"] = "[LT] Oink.",
  ["Il2"] = "[LT] Good bye!",
  ["Il3"] = "[LT] Greetings, traveller |PLAYERNAME|. Where do you want me to {fly} you?",
  ["Il4"] = "[LT] Good bye!",
  ["Il5"] = "[LT] Have a nice day.",
  ["Il6"] = "[LT] Welcome, young adventurer! Harr! {Deposit} your gold or {withdraw} \\z your money from your bank account. I can also explain the functions of your {bank} account to ya.",
  ["Il7"] = "[LT] Have a nice day.",
  ["Il8"] = "[LT] It was a pleasure to help you, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["Il9"] = "[LT] Hello.",
  ["IlA"] = "[LT] I can offer you the holy tible for a small fee.",
  ["IlB"] = "[LT] Now, it is |TIME|.",
  ["IlC"] = "[LT] They learned the ancient art of {dreamwalking} from some elves they befriended.",
  ["IlD"] = "[LT] While the dreamwalkers of the elves experienenced the brightest dreams of pleasure, the humans strangely had dreams of {dark omen}.",
  ["IlE"] = "[LT] They dreamed of doom, destruction, talked to dead, tormented souls, and gained unwanted insight into the {schemes of darkness}.",
  ["IlF"] = "[LT] They figured out how to interpret their dark dreams and so could foresee the plans of the dark gods and their minions.",
  ["IlG"] = "[LT] Using this knowledge they formed an order to thwart these plans, and because they battled their nightmares as brave as knights, they named their order accordingly.",
  ["IlH"] = "[LT] It is rumoured to open the entrance to the pits of inferno, also called the nightmare pits. Even if I knew about this secret I wouldn't tell you.",
  ["IlI"] = "[LT] Before the battles raged across them, they were called the fair plains.",
  ["IlJ"] = "[LT] Take care, it's dangerous out there.",
  ["IlK"] = "[LT] It was a pleasure to help you, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["IlL"] = "[LT] Hello. How may I help you |PLAYERNAME|? Ask me for a {trade} if you want to buy something. I can also explain the {mail} system.",
  ["IlM"] = "[LT] At last, a visitor! Welcome to my... humble abode. {Scroll} or {mission}?",
  ["IlN"] = "[LT] Well done! But know this: The cursed crystal seems to regenerate over time. It could be necessary to come back and repeat whatever you have done down there.",
  ["IlO"] = "[LT] Hello there. I'm sorry, I hardly noticed you. I'm a bit nervous. The spooky {sounds} down there, you know",
  ["IlP"] = "[LT] Hello, |PLAYERNAME|. You've come at a good time for our {project}.",
  ["IlQ"] = "[LT] Good bye, child.",
  ["IlR"] = "[LT] Welcome, young adventurer. Tell me if you need help in \\z {choosing} your {vocation}, or if you have {decided} on the {vocation} you want to choose.",
  ["IlS"] = "[LT] Welcome to the temple of Dawnport, child. \\z If you need {healing}, I can help you. Ask me about a {vocation} if you need counsel.",
  ["IlT"] = "[LT] What's your business here with the {magicians}, |PLAYERNAME|?",
  ["IlU"] = "[LT] Finally!",
  ["IlV"] = "[LT] Oh, hello |PLAYERNAME|. What is it?",
  ["IlW"] = "[LT] Good bye, and don't come back too soon.",
  ["IlX"] = "[LT] Farewell.",
  ["IlY"] = "[LT] Welcome to our humble guild, wanderer. May I be of any assistance to you?",
  ["IlZ"] = "[LT] Farewell.",
  ["Ila"] = "[LT] Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["Ilb"] = "[LT] Greetings.",
  ["Ilc"] = "[LT] Salutations, |PLAYERNAME| I guess you are here for the {horses}.",
  ["Ild"] = "[LT] Good bye, visit me again. I will be here, promised.",
  ["Ile"] = "[LT] Welcome to my little kingdom, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["Ilf"] = "[LT] Good bye, visit me again. I will be here, promised.",
  ["Ilg"] = "[LT] Have a nice day.",
  ["Ilh"] = "[LT] Welcome |PLAYERNAME|! Special newcomer offer, today only! Deposit some money - or {deposit ALL} of your money! - and get 50 gold for free!",
  ["Ili"] = "[LT] Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?",
  ["Ilj"] = "[LT] Have a nice day.",
  ["Ilk"] = "[LT] Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["Ill"] = "[LT] Greetings, young man. Looking for a passage or some fish, |PLAYERNAME|?",
  ["Ilm"] = "[LT] Good bye.",
  ["Iln"] = "[LT] Farewell, and may Justice be with you!",
  ["Ilo"] = "[LT] Wait... will you take me a diamond when you're back?",
  ["Ilp"] = "[LT] Be greeted |PLAYERNAME|!",
  ["Ilq"] = "[LT] Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["Ilr"] = "[LT] Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["Ils"] = "[LT] Goodbye citizen!",
  ["Ilt"] = "[LT] Hello. Unless you have official business here or want to pass the gate, please move on.",
  ["Ilu"] = "[LT] Bye.",
  ["Ilv"] = "[LT] Welcome on board, |PLAYERNAME|. Where can I {sail} you today?",
  ["Ilw"] = "[LT] Bye",
  ["Ilx"] = "[LT] Go and be careful. Remember what you have learned!",
  ["Ily"] = "[LT] Hello, mighty adventurer |PLAYERNAME|. Can I teach you something you don't know?",
  ["Ilz"] = "[LT] Did the bell ring?",
  ["Im"] = "[LT] Don't feed the necromants.",
  ["Im0"] = "[LT] See you my friend.",
  ["Im1"] = "[LT] Have fun!",
  ["Im2"] = "[LT] Hello there, mate. Here for a {trade}? My stock's just been refilled.",
  ["Im3"] = "[LT] HEHEHE! I knew you don't have the stomach.",
  ["Im4"] = "[LT] |PLAYERNAME| HEHEHEHE! Another fool visits the {tower}! Excellent!",
  ["Im5"] = "[LT] FOOL! Now you're doomed! But well ... \\z So be it! Let's start out with the Seal of Knowledge and the first question: \\z What name did the necromant king choose for himself?",
  ["Im6"] = "[LT] HOHO! You have learned your lesson well. \\z Question number two then: Who or what is the feared Hugo?",
  ["Im7"] = "[LT] Hm. I bet you think you're smart. All right. \\z How about this: What does everybody want to become but nobody to be?",
  ["Im8"] = "[LT] UHM UH OH ... How could you guess that? Are you mad??? All right. \\z Penultimate question: What is the opposite?",
  ["Im9"] = "[LT] NO! NO! NO! That can't be true. You're not only mad, you are a complete idiot! \\z Ah well. Here is the last question: What is 1 plus 1?",
  ["ImA"] = "[LT] May the gods bless you, |PLAYERNAME|!",
  ["ImB"] = "[LT] Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free.",
  ["ImC"] = "[LT] Remember: If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can heal you for free.",
  ["ImD"] = "[LT] Whatever.",
  ["ImE"] = "[LT] Yeah, another fool {disturbing} me, what a joy.",
  ["ImF"] = "[LT] Whatever.",
  ["ImG"] = "[LT] Hope to see you again.",
  ["ImH"] = "[LT] Welcome, |PLAYERNAME|! Do you feel adventurous? Do you want a weekly {ticket} for the ore wagon system here? You can use it right here to get to the centre of Kazordoon!",
  ["ImI"] = "[LT] May the fire in your heart never die, |PLAYERNAME|!",
  ["ImJ"] = "[LT] Be greeted |PLAYERNAME|! I can smell the scent of a phoenix on you!",
  ["ImK"] = "[LT] May the fire in your heart never die.",
  ["ImL"] = "[LT] COME BACK ANYTIME AND BRING ME TREASURES.",
  ["ImM"] = "[LT] I {AWAITED} YOU!",
  ["ImN"] = "[LT] COME BACK ANYTIME AND BRING ME TREASURES.",
  ["ImO"] = "[LT] Hi!",
  ["ImP"] = "[LT] Farewell, |PLAYERNAME|!",
  ["ImQ"] = "[LT] May the gods bless you, |PLAYERNAME|!",
  ["ImR"] = "[LT] Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free or you want the {adventurer stone}?",
  ["ImS"] = "[LT] Remember: If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can heal you for free.",
  ["ImT"] = "[LT] Good bye.",
  ["ImU"] = "[LT] Ah, a customer! Please feel free to browse my wares, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["ImV"] = "[LT] Good bye.",
  ["ImW"] = "[LT] Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["ImX"] = "[LT] Welcome |PLAYERNAME|! Whats your need?",
  ["ImY"] = "[LT] Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["ImZ"] = "[LT] Have a nice day.",
  ["Ima"] = "[LT] Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?",
  ["Imb"] = "[LT] Have a nice day.",
  ["Imc"] = "[LT] Good bye. Recommend us if you were satisfied with our service.",
  ["Imd"] = "[LT] Welcome on board, |PLAYERNAME|. I can travel you to {evil isle}.",
  ["Ime"] = "[LT] Good bye then.",
  ["Imf"] = "[LT] Good bye. Recommend us if you were satisfied with our service.",
  ["Img"] = "[LT] Welcome on board, |PLAYERNAME|. I can travel you to {kazordoon}.",
  ["Imh"] = "[LT] Good bye then.",
  ["Imi"] = "[LT] Farewell, |PLAYERNAME|, may the winds guide your way.",
  ["Imj"] = "[LT] Ah, a customer! Be greeted, |PLAYERNAME|!",
  ["Imk"] = "[LT] Come back soon!",
  ["Iml"] = "[LT] Farewell, |PLAYERNAME|, may the winds guide your way.",
  ["Imm"] = "[LT] Ah, a customer! Be greeted, |PLAYERNAME|!",
  ["Imn"] = "[LT] Come back soon!",
  ["Imo"] = "[LT] Meep!",
  ["Imp"] = "[LT] Meep? I mean - hello! Sorry, |PLAYERNAME|... Being a {rat} has kind of grown on me.",
  ["Imq"] = "[LT] Meep!",
  ["Imr"] = "[LT] Good bye.",
  ["Ims"] = "[LT] Be greeted. Is there anything I can {do for you}?",
  ["Imt"] = "[LT] Oh well.",
  ["Imu"] = "[LT] Daraman's blessings.",
  ["Imv"] = "[LT] Greetings |PLAYERNAME|. What leads you to me?",
  ["Imw"] = "[LT] Good bye sweetie.",
  ["Imx"] = "[LT] Hello sweetie. If you need general equipment, stuff like that, let me know.",
  ["Imy"] = "[LT] See you my friend.",
  ["Imz"] = "[LT] Hello, my friend.",
  ["In"] = "[LT] Are we talking about Noodles?",
  ["In0"] = "[LT] Good bye.",
  ["In1"] = "[LT] Greetings, daring adventurer. If you need a {passage}, let me know.",
  ["In2"] = "[LT] Oh well.",
  ["In3"] = "[LT] Good bye.",
  ["In4"] = "[LT] Greetings, daring adventurer. If you need a {passage}, let me know.",
  ["In5"] = "[LT] Oh well.",
  ["In6"] = "[LT] Welcome to my fruit and vegetable store, |PLAYERNAME|! Ask me for a {trade} if you'd like to see my wares.",
  ["In7"] = "[LT] Goodbye. Human. Being!",
  ["In8"] = "[LT] The. Slime. Has. Entered. Our. Master. Has. Left! We. Must. Help.",
  ["In9"] = "[LT] Goodbye. Human. Being!",
  ["InA"] = "[LT] COWARD! CHICKEN! HEHEHEHE!",
  ["InB"] = "[LT] See you next time!",
  ["InC"] = "[LT] Hrmpf, I'd say welcome if I felt like lying.",
  ["InD"] = "[LT] No patience at all!",
  ["InE"] = "[LT] Promise to come back sometime, will ya?",
  ["InF"] = "[LT] Everyone on this island has gone crazy! Except for me and you, it seems. Let's {trade} like normal people would.",
  ["InG"] = "[LT] Hey! Don't leave me alone with all these lunatics!",
  ["InH"] = "[LT] Goodbye then, |PLAYERNAME|!",
  ["InI"] = "[LT] Welcome, this is the {Gray Beach temple}, |PLAYERNAME|. Whether you are wounded, poisoned - or wait, don't tell me - yes, this is probably a case of being more emotionally hurt, I will do my best to {heal} you.",
  ["InJ"] = "[LT] Only the best for you.",
  ["InK"] = "[LT] Have a nice day.",
  ["InL"] = "[LT] Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?",
  ["InM"] = "[LT] Have a nice day.",
  ["InN"] = "[LT] Goodbye and please bring more gold next time <chuckles>. I mean, it would be nice to see you again.",
  ["InO"] = "[LT] I welcome thee, |PLAYERNAME|! I suppose you are looking for a trade in fine weapons!",
  ["InP"] = "[LT] Good bye.",
  ["InQ"] = "[LT] Greetings, traveller. I'm a magical trader and trainer for sorcerer spells. How may I help you?",
  ["InR"] = "[LT] Good bye.",
  ["InS"] = "[LT] Hello, my lad. Sit down, have a drink, why don't you?",
  ["InT"] = "[LT] Hunter's greeting! I assume you want something from me since you came all the way out here on your own. This is a dangerous place to be, I doubt that all my men will accept strangers like I do. You don't seem to have any problems with that, though.",
  ["InU"] = "[LT] Good bye. Come back soon.",
  ["InV"] = "[LT] Welcome to the finest weaponshop in the land, |PLAYERNAME|! Tell me if you're looking for a good {trade}.",
  ["InW"] = "[LT] Good bye. Come back soon.",
  ["InX"] = "[LT] Oh, good bye.",
  ["InY"] = "[LT] Oh, a customer. Hello |PLAYERNAME|. If you'd like to see my wonderful self-tailored clothes, ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["InZ"] = "[LT] Oh, good bye.",
  ["Ina"] = "[LT] Hello, my name is Saideh. Once this was the entry to the crypt of our heroes. One of the graves belongs to our beloved hero Dayyan. Nowadays it is not a good idea to visit this place.",
  ["Inb"] = "[LT] Well, bye then.",
  ["Inc"] = "[LT] Good bye and come again, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["Ind"] = "[LT] Welcome to my shop, adventurer |PLAYERNAME|! I {trade} with weapons and armor.",
  ["Ine"] = "[LT] Good bye and come again.",
  ["Inf"] = "[LT] Yes... then, goodbye.",
  ["Ing"] = "[LT] ...er... hello? Yes...? Well, if... if you have any questions - I am not even here.",
  ["Inh"] = "[LT] Yes... then, goodbye.",
  ["Ini"] = "[LT] Take care, |PLAYERNAME|!.",
  ["Inj"] = "[LT] Hello |PLAYERNAME|, nice to see you on Rookgaard! I saw you walking by and wondered if you could help me. Could you? Please, say {yes}!",
  ["Ink"] = "[LT] Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I gave you a fish to eat?",
  ["Inl"] = "[LT] Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I asked you if you saw Zirella! Did you?",
  ["Inm"] = "[LT] Hello again, |PLAYERNAME|! It's great to see you. If you like, we can chat a little. Just use the highlighted {keywords} again to choose a {topic}.",
  ["Inn"] = "[LT] Oh, |PLAYERNAME|, it's you again! It's probably impolite to disturb a busy adventurer like you, but I really need help. Please, say {yes}!",
  ["Ino"] = "[LT] Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Ahh, you found my chest. Let me take a look at you. You put on that coat, {yes}?",
  ["Inp"] = "[LT] Hey, I want to give you a weapon for free! You should not refuse that, in fact you should say '{yes}'!",
  ["Inq"] = "[LT] Good job! For that, I'll grant you 100 experience points! Oh - what was that? I think you advanced a level, {right}?",
  ["Inr"] = "[LT] Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I asked you if you saw your 'level up'! You did, {right}?",
  ["Ins"] = "[LT] Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I asked you if those nasty cockroaches {hurt} you! Did they?",
  ["Int"] = "[LT] Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I asked you if I should demonstrate some damage on you. Let's do it, {okay}?",
  ["Inu"] = "[LT] Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I was about to show you how you regain health, right?",
  ["Inv"] = "[LT] Good bye traveller, and enjoy your stay on Rookgaard.",
  ["Inw"] = "[LT] Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["Inx"] = "[LT] Oh, please come in, |PLAYERNAME|. What can I do for you? If you need adventure equipment, ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["Iny"] = "[LT] Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["Inz"] = "[LT] |PLAYERNAME|. I have been watching your fate for quite some time. It's about time you came here. Do you seek to enter the riven island of Quirefang or travel back from where you came?",
  ["Io"] = "[LT] Are we talking about Noodles?",
  ["Io0"] = "[LT] This place is... haunted... heed my warning... there are... ghooooooosts here...! Why are you giving me that... look? I am certain, there aaaaaaare ghosts here - I've seen them! Do you believe me?",
  ["Io1"] = "[LT] Gree... tings.",
  ["Io2"] = "[LT] LONG LIVE THE KING! You may leave now!",
  ["Io3"] = "[LT] LONG LIVE THE KING!",
  ["Io4"] = "[LT] Be greeted, |PLAYERNAME|! What brings you {here}?",
  ["Io5"] = "[LT] May enlightenment be your path, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["Io6"] = "[LT] Be greeted, mortal being!",
  ["Io7"] = "[LT] May enlightenment be your path, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["Io8"] = "[LT] May enlightenment be your path, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["Io9"] = "[LT] Greatings, mortal beigin.",
  ["IoA"] = "[LT] Good bye! And remember: No running up and down in the academy!",
  ["IoB"] = "[LT] Good bye!",
