  ["Ir9"] = "[LT] Farewell, human.",
  ["IrA"] = "[LT] Welcome, adventurer |PLAYERNAME|. These are dire times for Rookgaard... have you come to help in our {mission}?",
  ["IrB"] = "[LT] Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! How about that studded armor - would you like to have it now?",
  ["IrC"] = "[LT] |PLAYERNAME|! Thank the gods you are back! While you were gone, something horrible happened. Do you smell the fire?",
  ["IrD"] = "[LT] Oh my, what happened to your hair? Your face is all black, too - it must have been a hell of flames down there. That's so brave of you. Did you get the book?",
  ["IrE"] = "[LT] Are you prepared for your next mission, |PLAYERNAME|?",
  ["IrF"] = "[LT] Now that you know how to store your money, it's time to go after the trolls. I'm even going to give you some more equipment as reward. Do you feel ready for that mission?",
  ["IrG"] = "[LT] |PLAYERNAME|, welcome back! That was great work you did there. Let me give you something for your efforts - you deserve it. Here, want a helmet?",
  ["IrH"] = "[LT] Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Do you have enough space for the brass helmet now?",
  ["IrI"] = "[LT] Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Are you ready for your next mission?",
  ["IrJ"] = "[LT] Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. I see you haven't explored the whole crypt yet - do you need explanations again?",
  ["IrK"] = "[LT] Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Did you find a nice, fleshy bone in the crypt?",
  ["IrL"] = "[LT] Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Your task is still not done - do you remember everything you need to do?",
  ["IrM"] = "[LT] Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Do you have enough space for that sword now?",
  ["IrN"] = "[LT] Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|! I'm in a really good mood, I must say. We're almost able to infiltrate Kraknaknork's hideout. I have one last little favour to ask and then my plan is complete. Are you ready?",
  ["IrO"] = "[LT] Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! But - back so soon? Please find the wasps' lair in the north-western region of Rookgaard and use the flask I gave you on its dead body. Or did you lose the flask?",
  ["IrP"] = "[LT] Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Were you able to bring back some wasp poison?",
  ["IrQ"] = "[LT] Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Do you have enough space for that brass shield now?",
  ["IrR"] = "[LT] |PLAYERNAME|, the time of our triumph has come. Are you ready to vanquish Kraknaknork once and for all?",
  ["IrS"] = "[LT] |PLAYERNAME|! You're back! And you're covered in orc blood... that can only mean... were you able to kill Kraknaknork?",
  ["IrT"] = "[LT] Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. I've heard a loud rumbling from the roof - I hope the stones didn't fall on your toes. Have you loaded at least two catapults?",
  ["IrU"] = "[LT] Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Actually I have some more equipment I could give to you, but first I want to see how you fight. You have fought before, haven't you?",
  ["IrV"] = "[LT] Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|. Are you done with the 5 rats I asked you to kill?",
  ["IrW"] = "[LT] Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|. Glad to see you made it back in one piece. I hope you're not too exhausted, because I could use your {help} again.",
  ["IrX"] = "[LT] Oh, hello |PLAYERNAME|! Have you made up your mind about sneaking into the tarantula's lair and retrieving a sample of her web? Are you up for it?",
  ["IrY"] = "[LT] Do you need the instruction for the tarantula's lair again?",
  ["IrZ"] = "[LT] Oh, well done! Let me take that spider web sample from you - careful, careful... it's sturdy, yet fragile. Thank you! I should be able to make a great paralyse trap with this one. Here, I have something sturdy for you as well - want it?",
