  ["Isp"] = "[LT] Muhahaha.",
  ["Isq"] = "[LT] Another visitor to this constricted, cosy, calm realm, perfect except for an {exit}. Muhaha.",
  ["It"] = "[LT] Humourless old guy! Once, he turned me into a frog for painting his distasteful cave in pink.",
  ["Iu"] = "[LT] A man of steel with a stomach of wax. Never offer him a beer!",
  ["Iv"] = "[LT] He's my baby brother. If you tell him I sent you, he will grant you an extra spell or two.",
  ["Iw"] = "[LT] He sells spell scrolls each day at midnight, but you have to address him that very second.",
  ["Ix"] = "[LT] I better make no jokes about THIS matter.",
  ["Iy"] = "[LT] Did you know that he sells a 'power axe of doom' now? Run and buy it, he only has got three in store.",
  ["Iz"] = "[LT] He would make a fine jester, too.",
  ["J0"] = "[LT] So receive the protection of the twist of fate, pilgrim.",
  ["J1"] = "[LT] No problem.",
  ["J2"] = "[LT] I think you have forgotten to bring your stake, pilgrim.",
  ["J3"] = "[LT] Yes, I have been informed and haven't yet drunk enough to forget, so you can count yourself lucky. Are you prepared to <hicks> receive my line of the prayer?",
  ["J4"] = "[LT] So receive my prayer: 'Your hand shall be guided - your feet shall walk in <hicks> harmony'. Now, take your stake to Tyrias in <hicks> Liberty Bay for the next line of the prayer. I shall let him know what he is to do.",
  ["J5"] = "[LT] I'll wait for you.",
  ["J6"] = "[LT] You should visit Tyrias in Liberty Bay now.",
  ["J7"] = "[LT] You have already received my line of the prayer. Don't make me do more work than necessary!",
  ["J8"] = "[LT] A blessed stake? That's a <hicks> strange request. Maybe Quentin knows more, he is one of the oldest monks after all.",
  ["J9"] = "[LT] You are hurt, my child. I will heal your wounds.",
  ["JA"] = "[LT] Why do trolls live underground? ... Because there are so many pks on the surface!",
  ["JB"] = "[LT] Why are bonelords so ugly? ... Because their mom and dad were bonelords, too!",
  ["JC"] = "[LT] I wanted to become a sorcerer, too, but I was overqualified!",
  ["JD"] = "[LT] Why does the rat have a wooden leg? ... Because it is a former pirate!",
  ["JE"] = "[LT] Why did the spider cross the road? ... Because it ... oh you already know this one!?",
  ["JF"] = "[LT] I had a cousin named like that.",
  ["JG"] = "[LT] He died some years ago.",
  ["JH"] = "[LT] Isn't he the author of the book 'Fun with Demons'?",
  ["JI"] = "[LT] He is kind of a father figure to me. Of course he denies all kinship to me.",
  ["JJ"] = "[LT] He's a smart one. I heared he hid in a foreign country as the first bugs showed up.",
  ["JK"] = "[LT] I am not foolish enough to believe in the existence of this weapon.",
  ["JL"] = "[LT] Oh, I saw some demon carvings in the dungeons as I hid there after a little joke on old Stutch.",
  ["JM"] = "[LT] Yes, they showed demons, seven actually, dancing around a sword! In something like a flaming pit.",
  ["JN"] = "[LT] I wanted to become a druid, too, but I was overqualified!",
  ["JO"] = "[LT] Ah, don't ask me! Usually mages and mystics know more about such stuff.",
  ["JP"] = "[LT] I'm the royal jes ... uhm ... the royal tax-collector! Do you want to pay your taxes?",
  ["JQ"] = "[LT] Come back, when you have enough money.",
  ["JR"] = "[LT] Thank you very much. I will have a drink or two on your health!",
  ["JS"] = "[LT] Well, perhaps later.",
  ["JT"] = "[LT] I actually know some spells! Do you want to learn how to 'lessen your load' for 200 gold?",
  ["JU"] = "[LT] Come back, when you have enough money.",
  ["JV"] = "[LT] Here you are, I already lessened your load.",
  ["JW"] = "[LT] You don't know what offer you are missing!",
  ["JX"] = "[LT] Do you want to buy a 'mace of the fury' for 250 gold?",
  ["JY"] = "[LT] I wanted to become a paladin, too, but I was overqualified!",
  ["JZ"] = "[LT] Come back, when you have enough money.",
  ["Ja"] = "[LT] And here it is, it suits you well!",
  ["Jb"] = "[LT] You dont know what offer you have passed!",
  ["Jc"] = "[LT] Uh, go away!",
  ["Jd"] = "[LT] Do you want to kiss me?",
  ["Je"] = "[LT] Uh, oh! ... I am seeing stars!",
  ["Jf"] = "[LT] Pah, I didn't want to kiss you anyway!",
  ["Jg"] = "[LT] Well, women don't behave necessarily in a ladylike way just because they dress like one!",
  ["Jh"] = "[LT] Has any man said to you that you're not only beautiful but also intelligent?",
  ["Ji"] = "[LT] This is a world of fantasy and full of surprises!",
  ["Jj"] = "[LT] I wanted to become a knight, too, but I was overqualified!",
  ["Jk"] = "[LT] Well, think about it!",
  ["Jl"] = "[LT] The good thing about them is that they can't be at two places at the same time.",
  ["Jm"] = "[LT] Come chat with ol' Bozo!",
  ["Jn"] = "[LT] Do you know the one with the dragon? Where - and then ... hahahaha! Oh no, I guess I ruined it.",
  ["Jo"] = "[LT] The fools' guild? Are you serious? No, of course not! Hahaha!",
  ["Jp"] = "[LT] Welcome, welcome, step closer!",
  ["Jq"] = "[LT] You may buy all the things we grow or gather at this place.",
  ["Jr"] = "[LT] Life takes many forms. Plants are a very basic form of life. Its simplicity makes them close to the core of nature.",
  ["Js"] = "[LT] We abandoned the gods a long time ago. A short time after they abandoned us.",
  ["Jt"] = "[LT] They are lost, and if they still exist they are alone in the cold and the darkness.",
  ["Ju"] = "[LT] The Kuridai left the true path and can't see their error. Their way of living may have been suitable in the past, but if they don't come back to us, their path will lead into darkness.",
  ["Jv"] = "[LT] We have still much to learn but we are on the correct path at least.",
  ["Jw"] = "[LT] The Cenath forgot as many as they learned. I doubt they find the wisdom they are looking for without the things they neglected in their pursuit of knowledge.",
  ["Jx"] = "[LT] I don't claim to understand this creatures but sometimes they are more close to the roots than we are.",
  ["Jy"] = "[LT] They are so many, so planless, so divided. They choose a path I do not want for my own race.",
  ["Jz"] = "[LT] Life takes many forms. Plants are a very basic form of life. Its simplicity makes them close to the core of nature.",
  ["K0"] = "[LT] You shouldn't miss the experience.",
  ["K1"] = "[LT] You shouldn't miss the experience.",
  ["K2"] = "[LT] Get out o' here!*HICKS*",
  ["K3"] = "[LT] Where are we at the moment? Is this Svargrond? Ahh yes!*HICKS* Where do you want to go?",
  ["K4"] = "[LT] No, no, no, you even are no barb....barba...er.. one of us!!!! Talk to the Jarl first!",
  ["K5"] = "[LT] Ohh, you got a nice ring there! Ya don't have to pay if you gimme the ring and I promise you I will bring you to the correct spot!*HICKS* Alright?",
  ["K6"] = "[LT] Give me 50 gold and I bring you to ",
  ["K7"] = "[LT] You shouldn't miss the experience.",
  ["K8"] = "[LT] You shouldn't miss the experience.",
  ["K9"] = "[LT] Get out o' here!*HICKS*",
  ["KA"] = "[LT] You aren't looking that bad. Sorry, I can't help you. But if you are looking for additional protection you should go on the {pilgrimage} of ashes or get the protection of the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["KB"] = "[LT] Fine. You are free to decline my offer.",
  ["KC"] = "[LT] Whenever you receive a lethal wound, your vital force is damaged and there is a chance that you lose some of your equipment. With every single of the five {blessings} you have, this damage and chance of loss will be reduced.",
  ["KD"] = "[LT] There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.",
  ["KE"] = "[LT] I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["KF"] = "[LT] I can sense that the druids north of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.",
  ["KG"] = "[LT] I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["KH"] = "[LT] I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["KI"] = "[LT] I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.",
  ["KJ"] = "[LT] You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.",
  ["KK"] = "[LT] The druids north of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.",
  ["KL"] = "[LT] You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.",
  ["KM"] = "[LT] Keep your adventurer's stone well.",
  ["KN"] = "[LT] The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.",
  ["KO"] = "[LT] Talk to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya about this blessing.",
  ["KP"] = "[LT] Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for free?",
  ["KQ"] = "[LT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["KR"] = "[LT] No problem.",
  ["KS"] = "[LT] Ah, you want to replace your adventurer's stone for 30 gold?",
  ["KT"] = "[LT] Here you are. Take care.",
  ["KU"] = "[LT] Sorry, you don't have enough money.",
  ["KV"] = "[LT] Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["KW"] = "[LT] Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["KX"] = "[LT] Come and take a look at the finest gems in the lands of Tibia.",
  ["KY"] = "[LT] Passage to Cormaya! Unforgettable steamboat ride!",
  ["KZ"] = "[LT] Do you want me take you to {Cormaya}, {Farmine} or to {Gnomprona}?",
  ["Ka"] = "[LT] Passage to Cormaya! Unforgettable steamboat ride!",
  ["Kb"] = "[LT] This... person... makes me want to... say something bad... must... control myself. <sweats>",
  ["Kc"] = "[LT] Well, I sell freshly caught fish. You like some? Of course, you can buy more than one at once. *grin* Just ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["Kd"] = "[LT] Well, I sell freshly caught fish. You like some? Of course, you can buy more than one at once. *grin* Just ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["Ke"] = "[LT] Well, I sell freshly caught fish. You like some? Of course, you can buy more than one at once. *grin* Just ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["Kf"] = "[LT] My name is Bruno.",
  ["Kg"] = "[LT] My job is to catch fish and to sell them here.",
  ["Kh"] = "[LT] Ah yes, my lovely wife. God forgive her, but she can't stop talking. So my work is a great rest for my poor ears. *laughs loudly*",
  ["Ki"] = "[LT] I like this old salt. I learned much from him. Whatever. You like some fish? *grin*",
