  ["LH"] = "[LT] Where are we at the moment? Is this Svargrond? Ahh yes!*HICKS* Where do you want to go?",
  ["LI"] = "[LT] I'm the foreman of this {mine}.",
  ["LJ"] = "[LT] You may enter the tunnel.",
  ["LK"] = "[LT] This is no funhouse. Leave the miners and their drilling-worms alone and get out! We have already enough trouble without you.",
  ["LL"] = "[LT] We understand the ways of the earth like nobody else.",
  ["LM"] = "[LT] I'm a miner, not your mother. Go ask someone else.",
  ["LN"] = "[LT] The hideout of the Horned Fox is probably a dangerous if not lethal place for inexperienced adventurers. It is the source of all the {trouble} around here.",
  ["LO"] = "[LT] He is a minotaur who was kicked out of Mintwallin. He must have some kind of {hideout} nearby.",
  ["LP"] = "[LT] This is not an amusement park! Leave the miners and their drilling-worms alone and get out! We've already got enough {trouble} without you.",
  ["LQ"] = "[LT] We occasionally come across nasty beasts in the deepest mines.",
  ["LR"] = "[LT] My name is Budrik Deepdigger, Son of Earth, from the Molten Rock.",
  ["LS"] = "[LT] The {Horned Fox} is leading his bandits in sneak attacks and raids on us.",
  ["LT"] = "[LT] Salutations, commoner |PLAYERNAME|!",
  ["LU"] = "[LT] Our city blends in with the nature surrounding it. Our {druids} take care of that.",
  ["LV"] = "[LT] They are our main magic support and play a major role in our battle {tactics}.",
  ["LW"] = "[LT] Our tactic is to kiss.",
  ["LX"] = "[LT] K.I.S.S.! Keep It Simple, Stupid! Complicated tactics are too easy to be crushed by a twist of fate.",
  ["LY"] = "[LT] Our elite forces are trained by rangers and druids. In the woods they come a close second to elves.",
  ["LZ"] = "[LT] Join what?",
  ["La"] = "[LT] Sorry, we don't recruit foreigners. Maybe you can join if you prove yourself in a mission for the queen.",
  ["Lb"] = "[LT] We are in constant training and in perfect health.",
  ["Lc"] = "[LT] I am the general of the queen's army. I don't have time to explain this concept to you.",
  ["Ld"] = "[LT] Our family has been serving the Carlin army since countless generations!",
  ["Le"] = "[LT] Our family has been serving the Carlin army since countless generations!",
  ["Lf"] = "[LT] She is one of my beloved sisters and serves Carlin as a town guard.",
  ["Lg"] = "[LT] HAIL TO QUEEN ELOISE, OUR NOBLE {LEADER}!",
  ["Lh"] = "[LT] Queen Eloise is a fine leader for our fair town, indeed!",
  ["Li"] = "[LT] The army protects the defenceless males of our {city}. Our elite forces are the {Green Ferrets}.",
  ["Lj"] = "[LT] Behave yourself as long as you are in Carlin, commoner!",
  ["Lk"] = "[LT] I wish I could learn more about this strange world.",
  ["Ll"] = "[LT] Those different cultures are amazing.",
  ["Lm"] = "[LT] What an interesting continent.",
  ["Ln"] = "[LT] The goal is for Canary to be an 'engine', that is, it will be \\z\n\t\t\t\ta server with a 'clean' datapack, with as few things as possible, \\z\n\t\t\t\tthus facilitating development and testing.",
  ["Lo"] = "[LT] This the our discord group link: {https://discordapp.com/invite/3NxYnyV}",
  ["Lp"] = "[LT] The goal is for Canary to be an 'engine', that is, it will be a server with a 'clean' datapack, with as few things as possible, thus facilitating development and testing.",
  ["Lq"] = "[LT] See more on our {discord group}.",
  ["Lr"] = "[LT] I can promote you for 20000 gold coins. Do you want me to promote you?",
  ["Ls"] = "[LT] Alright then, come back when you are ready.",
  ["Lt"] = "[LT] Welcome to the Canary Server!",
  ["Lu"] = "[LT] Passages to Carlin, Ab'Dendriel, Edron, Venore, Port Hope, Liberty Bay, Yalahar, Roshamuul, Krailos, Oramond and Svargrond.",
  ["Lv"] = "[LT] The Royal Tibia Line connects all seaside towns of Tibia.",
  ["Lw"] = "[LT] The Royal Tibia Line connects all seaside towns of Tibia.",
  ["Lx"] = "[LT] We can transport everything you want.",
  ["Ly"] = "[LT] We would like to welcome you on board.",
  ["Lz"] = "[LT] Where do you want to go? To {Carlin}, {Ab'Dendriel}, {Venore}, {Port Hope}, {Liberty Bay}, {Svargrond}, {Yalahar}, {Roshamuul}, {Oramond} or {Edron}?",
  ["M0"] = "[LT] She's pretty, isn't she? Will ship you safely to any port. Though a young landlubber such as you should \\z\n\tconsider to travel to Thais first. The travel is for free. Just once though! You have to ask for a {passage}.",
  ["M1"] = "[LT] You chose a peaceful world. Not much danger from other adventurers. Just beware the monsters. \\z\n\tWant go there, ask for a {passage}.",
  ["M2"] = "[LT] No smuggling aboard this ship! Only 20 pieces of any creature product allowed!",
  ["M3"] = "[LT] No fear! The Sea Cat will ship you safely to the mainland!",
  ["M4"] = "[LT] All aboard! Prepare to sail!",
  ["M5"] = "[LT] Come hell or high water, we'll reach any port I sail you to!",
  ["M6"] = "[LT] This island is too small. I need sea water around me.",
  ["M7"] = "[LT] Passages to Thais, Carlin, Ab'Dendriel, Krailos, Port Hope, Edron, Darashia, Liberty Bay, Svargrond, Gray Island, Yalahar and Ankrahmun.",
  ["M8"] = "[LT] Where do you want to go? To {Issavi} {krailos}, {Thais}, {Carlin}, {Ab'Dendriel}, {Port Hope}, {Edron}, {Darashia}, {Liberty Bay}, {Svargrond}, {Yalahar}, {Gray Island} or {Ankrahmun}?",
  ["M9"] = "[LT] I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["MA"] = "[LT] I'm sorry, but we don't serve the routes to the Ice Islands.",
  ["MB"] = "[LT] I'm not sailing there. This route is afflicted by a ghostship! However I've heard that Captain Fearless from Venore sails there.",
  ["MC"] = "[LT] I'm not sailing there. This route is afflicted by a ghostship! However I've heard that Captain Fearless from Venore sails there.",
  ["MD"] = "[LT] Many people who sailed to Darashia never returned because they were attacked by a ghostship! I'll never sail there!",
  ["ME"] = "[LT] This is Thais. Where do you want to go?",
  ["MF"] = "[LT] Do you seek a passage to ",
  ["MG"] = "[LT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["MH"] = "[LT] My name is Captain Bluebear from the Royal Tibia Line.",
  ["MI"] = "[LT] I am the captain of this sailing-ship.",
  ["MJ"] = "[LT] I am the captain of this sailing-ship.",
  ["MK"] = "[LT] The Royal Tibia Line connects all seaside towns of Tibia.",
  ["ML"] = "[LT] The Royal Tibia Line connects all seaside towns of Tibia.",
  ["MM"] = "[LT] Passages to Carlin, Ab'Dendriel, Edron, Venore, Port Hope, Liberty Bay, Yalahar, Roshamuul, Krailos, Oramond and Svargrond.",
  ["MN"] = "[LT] Do you seek a passage to ",
  ["MO"] = "[LT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["MP"] = "[LT] Where do you want to go? To {Carlin}, {Venore} or {Thais}?",
  ["MQ"] = "[LT] Where do you want to go? To {Carlin}, {Venore} or {Thais}?",
  ["MR"] = "[LT] I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["MS"] = "[LT] I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["MT"] = "[LT] This is Svargrond. Where do you want to go?",
  ["MU"] = "[LT] By direct edict of the honorable Henricus, we are ordered to give passage for all recruits to Thais.",
  ["MV"] = "[LT] Do you seek a passage to Thais for |TRAVELCOST|?",
  ["MW"] = "[LT] By direct edict of the honorable Henricus himself... well, you know.",
  ["MX"] = "[LT] I can bring you back to {Thais} if you are weary or you can stay and fight. What shall it be?",
  ["MY"] = "[LT] My name is Chelop and I am a captain of this {inquisition} ship.",
  ["MZ"] = "[LT] Can't you see? I'm captain of the Pesadilla, the proud {inquisition} ship which anchors here.",
  ["Ma"] = "[LT] By edict of the honorable Henricus himself, we are ordered to give passage to all recruits of the Roshamuul mission for a small fee.",
  ["Mb"] = "[LT] This is the island you are currently on, just in case you forgot.",
  ["Mc"] = "[LT] By direct edict of the honorable Henricus, we are ordered to give passage for all recruits to Thais.",
  ["Md"] = "[LT] I can bring you to our base in Liberty Bay for |TRAVELCOST|. Is that what you want?",
  ["Me"] = "[LT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["Mf"] = "[LT] I can take you to {Liberty Bay}.",
  ["Mg"] = "[LT] I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["Mh"] = "[LT] I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["Mi"] = "[LT] I travelled here, hoping to find the cockaigne. Imagine my disappointment when I discovered I was wrong.",
  ["Mj"] = "[LT] No smuggling aboard this ship! Only 20 pieces of any creature product allowed!",
  ["Mk"] = "[LT] That old place? Sorry, I don't sail there, no loot to be had.",
  ["Ml"] = "[LT] Some regions in the world can't be accessed by everyone. Gotta pay, you know? \\z\n\tIf you spend some real cash for premium time, I can bring you to much more challenging locations.",
  ["Mm"] = "[LT] That's what the whole place is called.",
  ["Mn"] = "[LT] Good. Got all you want to take to the mainland, {yes}? Gear, limbs, loot?",
  ["Mo"] = "[LT] What? Then what DO you want? Learn about the main Tibian {cities}?",
  ["Mp"] = "[LT] While you take time to ponder, I will just stroll over there and pretend not to listen to you thinking.",
  ["Mq"] = "[LT] Well, I can tell you stuff about ",
  ["Mr"] = "[LT] So you know it all, huh? Where do you want me to bring you to, kid? |TOWNS|?",
  ["Ms"] = "[LT] Do you want to know about ",
  ["Mt"] = "[LT] So, you've decided on your new home city? Which one will it be?",
  ["Mu"] = "[LT] No fear! The Sea Cat will ship you safely to the mainland!",
  ["Mv"] = "[LT] All aboard! Prepare to sail!",
  ["Mw"] = "[LT] Come hell or high water, we'll reach any port I sail you to!",
  ["Mx"] = "[LT] This island is too small. I need sea water around me.",
  ["My"] = "[LT] Ruby Dreadnought. But it's Captain Dreadnought to you!",
  ["Mz"] = "[LT] I'm captain of this little sloop here, the Sea Cat.",
  ["N0"] = "[LT] I am the captain of the 'Sea Goddess', the splendid and beautiful ship you see over there.",
  ["N1"] = "[LT] I am the captain of the 'Sea Goddess', the splendid and beautiful ship you see over there.",
  ["N2"] = "[LT] The 'Sea Goddess' is the most beautiful in Oramond, a whole new model of ship, elegant, sure and swift. There's no weather she can't take!",
  ["N3"] = "[LT] Ah, your lands are quite a sight! I have only visited Thais so far, but I think of navigating to more cities, when the time - and public demand - comes.",
  ["N4"] = "[LT] I will gladly take on board everything you wish to transport. No pets, though.",
  ["N5"] = "[LT] Passages to Thais and Krailos! Visit the strange lands!",
  ["N6"] = "[LT] Is this a mutiny or what? Move, move!!",
  ["N7"] = "[LT] Dis is no passenger ship it's a WARship. I'm on hunting business.",
  ["N8"] = "[LT] Never heard of him. He is no captain that's for sure, otherwise I'd know him. I was on the sea for the last 20 years hunting this, this monster.",
  ["N9"] = "[LT] Yee, I've been chasing that monster for over 20 years now. I promise I'll bring it down!",
  ["NA"] = "[LT] I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["NB"] = "[LT] This is Venore. Where do you want to go?",
