  ["Nw"] = "[LT] This is the only safe landing place on Oramond. The cliffs surrounding the isle are too dangerous, you see.",
  ["Nx"] = "[LT] Do you seek a passage to ",
  ["Ny"] = "[LT] We would like to serve you some time.",
  ["Nz"] = "[LT] Ah, you may not have heard of me. I am Captain Gulliver, the first Oramondian for a hundred years to have sailed through the mist to your strange lands.",
  ["O0"] = "[LT] You shouldn't miss the experience.",
  ["O1"] = "[LT] Welcome on board, noble |PLAYERNAME|. I can bring you to {Calassa} or {Yalahar}, but only if you have the according mission from {Berenice} or {Wyrdin}.",
  ["O2"] = "[LT] Welcome on board, noble |PLAYERNAME|. I can bring you to {Calassa} or {Yalahar}, but only if you have the according mission from {Berenice} or {Wyrdin}.",
  ["O3"] = "[LT] I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["O4"] = "[LT] I am the captain of this ship.",
  ["O5"] = "[LT] Whoah. That was a large shadow passing by.",
  ["O6"] = "[LT] Whoah. That was a large shadow passing by.",
  ["O7"] = "[LT] Do you want go back to Liberty Bay?",
  ["O8"] = "[LT] Maybe another time, then.",
  ["O9"] = "[LT] Do you want go back to {Liberty Bay}?",
  ["OA"] = "[LT] It lets me forget the long years, the lost years. The years I was chasing after THAT monster, the sea serpent.",
  ["OB"] = "[LT] Ye, I command 'is ship!",
  ["OC"] = "[LT] Our last ship has been destroyed by the most evil creature of the ocean: the sea serpent. To continue our hunt, I've bought this ship here.",
  ["OD"] = "[LT] Never seen one.",
  ["OE"] = "[LT] I'm faithful - I'll catch that monster one day. Yes I will, as sure as my name is Captain Haba!!",
  ["OF"] = "[LT] On the high seas there is no queen. At least I didn't see her yet. Hararar!",
  ["OG"] = "[LT] On the high seas there is no king. At least I didn't see him yet. Hararar!",
  ["OH"] = "[LT] In the rigging ya lazy fools!",
  ["OI"] = "[LT] Arms, legs, head, whatever. I got injuries on almost every part of my body!",
  ["OJ"] = "[LT] This is no shop boy, this is a warship!",
  ["OK"] = "[LT] We aren't even near that location! Wanna swim? Harharhar!",
  ["OL"] = "[LT] I know Marvik in Thais. He once helped me with a furuncle I had on my ...ahh, doesn't matter. He's a nice gran'pa, though!",
  ["OM"] = "[LT] My worst enemy is a huge sea serpent. I dunno when I started to follow it's trail. I'll kill it and if it's the last thing I'll do, I'll kill it!",
  ["ON"] = "[LT] This is a ship and the captain is some kind o' leader, isn't he? <mumbles>..stupid..landlubber.",
  ["OO"] = "[LT] What fo' godsake shall that be??",
  ["OP"] = "[LT] Seems that they are some sort o' druids fo' the Norseman.",
  ["OQ"] = "[LT] I'm full of stories mate! Name a body part and I tell you the story what happened to it!",
  ["OR"] = "[LT] I wanna see you movin' ya lazy fools!!",
  ["OS"] = "[LT] Full sails!! There's a sea serpent to catch!!",
  ["OT"] = "[LT] My name is Haba, Captain Haba for ya little worm.",
  ["OU"] = "[LT] I ain't no pirate. Don't let yourself mislead by my pirate hat. I got it from a friend of mine.",
  ["OV"] = "[LT] Most o' my friends are dead the others don't like me anymore......well, seems there aren't many left.",
  ["OW"] = "[LT] What fo' godsake shall that be??",
  ["OX"] = "[LT] Who are ya calling a barbarian?!? Watch your tongue here on board or you end up as fish fodder!",
  ["OY"] = "[LT] Is this a mutiny or what? Move, move!!",
  ["OZ"] = "[LT] In the rigging ya lazy fools!",
  ["Oa"] = "[LT] I wanna see you movin' ya lazy fools!!",
  ["Ob"] = "[LT] Full sails!! There's a sea serpent to catch!!",
  ["Oc"] = "[LT] I'd go by myself and tear that beast's heart out if I were younger. I hope ya can do that for me. Now go and good luck to ya!",
  ["Od"] = "[LT] Ya're a coward, aren't ya? Prove that I'm wrong and get your lazy bones up to the lookout!!",
  ["Oe"] = "[LT] Just ask me for a trade if you need a bait.",
  ["Of"] = "[LT] I can give ya a challenge to test if ya have the guts to be a real sailor. Go up to the lookout and remain there for 24 hours during a storm! Harharhar!",
  ["Og"] = "[LT] Come on board! The winds are prosperous!",
